{"title":"2014 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are 200 people at the beach, and 65% of these people are children.If 40% of the children are swimming, how many children are swimming?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/1/ff169c8eb4e8e515216bcd0f6f207a78af94c8b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$65\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of the total <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/3/8f37626d49b4082c9102bf930bca51277ff2eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> people at the beach are children, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/8/4c884665de868c11a92e45eb76f9ca865db95df0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$65\\% \\times 200 = \\frac{65}{100} \\times 200 = 130$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"241\" height=\"38\" /> children are at the beach.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/e/f4e4e5c6d549ce47918b94180cad5c1644d9ea88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of the total <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/d/7ed053c218042da5437116773b5ec17ac57d8a4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$130$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> children at the beach are swimming, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/b/c8bad3ad10bc8b9048bf371d487a1729066c6c2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40\\% \\times 130 = \\frac{4}{10} \\times 130 = \\boxed{52}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"234\" height=\"38\" /> of the people at the beach are children who are swimming.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/8/c98898cf5a51a1898925ccd1bb97b6e696802bfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$65\\% = \\frac{65}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"38\" /> of the people at the beach are children and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/a/6ca44ff59d36eca411d817ff1f899ea447a44a76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40\\% = \\frac{4}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"82\" height=\"38\" /> of the children at the beach are swimming, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/8/4b862db85e3dfb66315406993353f3df4606445b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{65}{100} \\times \\frac{4}{10} = \\frac{26}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"133\" height=\"38\" /> of the people at the beach are children that are swimming.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/3/8f37626d49b4082c9102bf930bca51277ff2eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> people are at the beach, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/2/6021cf8a061cce981d934d64dcfd10367cd680a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{26}{100} \\times 200 = \\boxed{52}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"136\" height=\"38\" /> of the people at the beach are children who are swimming.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC\" title=\"2014 CIMC\">2014 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Intermediate_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Intermediate Competition\">CEMC Intermediate Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018060230\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 102/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1246/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 143/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2128/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.390      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n100.00%    7.390      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37077:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018060230 and revision id 286373. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}